{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28308","headline":"夏州崔常侍自少常亚列出领麾幢十韵 · 杜牧","name":"夏州崔常侍自少常亚列出领麾幢十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝命诗书将，登坛礼乐卿。\n三边要高枕，万里得长城。\n对客犹褒博，填门已斾旌。\n腰间五绶贵，天下一家荣。\n野水差新燕，芳郊哢夏莺。\n别风嘶玉勒，残日望金茎。\n榆塞孤烟媚，银川绿草明。\n戈矛虓虎士，弓箭落鵰兵。\n魏绦言堪采，陈汤事偶成。\n若须垂竹帛，静胜是功名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}